),
('e3000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011', 'ukmla', '21648530-cd78-429b-bc9c-43ccc1bcce6a',
  'draft', 'foundation',
  'An 80-year-old woman with advanced dementia lacks capacity to decide about long-term placement following a hip fracture. Her family disagree with the multidisciplinary team about whether she should return home with care or move to a care home, and no consensus can be reached despite a best-interests meeting involving her family, GP, and social worker.',
  'What is the most appropriate next step?',
