  'draft', 'core',
  'A 29-year-old man who was admitted voluntarily to a psychiatric ward 4 days ago for depression with emerging psychotic features now attempts to leave, stating he no longer wants treatment. The nursing staff are concerned he remains acutely unwell and at risk of self-harm if he leaves. No doctor with Section 12 approval or AMHP is immediately available, but a full Mental Health Act assessment needs to be arranged urgently.',
